# Fold as the only tool: a Map Each feeding a hand-written conditional sum.
# The compiler recognizes the reduction the Fold spells out (Sum By), and then
# streams the Map Each into it — the program below builds no list after the
# parse.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers
Cursed Technique: Map Each
    Using: (x) -> x * 7 % 1009
Maximum Technique: Fold
    Seed: 0
    Using: (acc, x) -> if x % 3 = 0 then acc + x * x else acc
Reveal: stdout
